<title>USA: Home Centers (DIY) Ltd Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Home Centers (DIY) Ltd Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr		     0.04		     0.26</p>
<p> Net			    197		    1,333</p>
