<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The above figures are in New Israeli Shekels. The company reported Q1 1997 earnings of US$59,000 or $0.01 per share on revenues of $25 million. It did not provide dollar figures for the first quarter of 1996.</p>
